Hi Sergio,

Could you please add the DMI product name "83GS" to the supported hardware
whitelist for the yogafan driver?

This is a Lenovo LOQ laptop, and it currently fails to probe with ENODEV on
kernel 7.1.2. Since this is a gaming model, it likely needs to be routed to
the 16-bit architecture mode to handle the higher RPM fan speeds.

Let me know if you need me to test a patch.  I have attached my DMI
hardware info and a full ACPI dump in case you need to verify the EC
register offsets for this specific board.


Warm regards,

*Sarbajit*

